WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.278
VitaCrypt joins DNA, blood tests, wearables and even air quality

2
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:09.914
into one profile, and labels each link cited or hypothesis.

3
00:00:10.614 --> 00:00:15.606
