5
00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:19.634
it.

6
00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:23.661
Early-stage MVP, synthetic demo data.

7
00:00:23.661 --> 00:00:27.438
Try it at vitacrypt.xyz/agent.
